33902: Title screen tune data (The Blue Danube)
Used by the routine at 37596. The tune data is organised into 95 groups of three bytes each, one group for each note in the tune. The first byte in each group determines the duration of the note, and the second and third bytes determine the frequency (and also the piano keys that light up).
